{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"lines-of-action UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"lines-of-action.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["lines-of-action.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ini mengikuti huraian peraturan ZXQPH0000QXZ×ZXQPH0001QXZ Persatuan Permainan Komputer Antarabangsa: dua belas bingkai setiap sisi, kiraan garisan penuh tepat, berdekatan diagonal untuk sambungan, laluan bila tidak boleh bergerak, dan draw pada kedudukan ketiga yang diulang. Varian yang diterbitkan berbeza pada sambungan serentak; pilih peraturan yang anda suka. Saingan komputer menggunakan heuristik setempat kecil dan bukan enjin pertandingan.","record_id":"24e27945a896b5eca59b5f7a90fb6f14a67abf0d3dbcde0a76322cdc22e6e8fa","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":2.304925510375142,"source":"This follows the International Computer Games Association’s 8×8 rule description: twelve pieces per side, exact full-line counts, diagonal adjacency for connection, passing when unable to move, and a draw on a third repeated position. A published variant differs on simultaneous connections; select the rule you prefer. The computer opponent uses a small local heuristic and is not a tournament engine.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"09b37b643e7a02924e95e8009e90c8027ced5eda7adb57dae972f935a23258d0","status":"needs-review","translation":"Ini mengikuti huraian peraturan 8×8 Persatuan Permainan Komputer Antarabangsa: dua belas bingkai setiap sisi, kiraan garisan penuh tepat, berdekatan diagonal untuk sambungan, laluan bila tidak boleh bergerak, dan draw pada kedudukan ketiga yang diulang. Varian yang diterbitkan berbeza pada sambungan serentak; pilih peraturan yang anda suka. Saingan komputer menggunakan heuristik setempat kecil dan bukan enjin pertandingan.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mortgage-points-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mortgage-points-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["mortgage-points-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Satu titik diskaun biasanya kos ZXQPH0000QXZ daripada jumlah pinjaman. Masukkan kadar tanpa titik, kadar yang dikutip dengan titik dan kos titik. Kalkulator ini membandingkan prinsip dan tempoh yang sama menggunakan amortisasi bulanan. Hasil horizon termasuk perbezaan pembayaran, baki pinjaman yang tinggal dan kos titik awal. Ia adalah anggaran, bukan tawaran pinjaman atau nasihat kewangan; peraturan pemberi pinjaman, cukai dan kos penutupan lain boleh mengubah hasil.","record_id":"2443127eef4a9b2ef56526c0def7889d90cbc8304f2be80d4d53e104cff50fa8","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.6756069171250374,"source":"One discount point usually costs 1% of the loan amount. Enter the rate without points, the quoted rate with points and the point cost. This calculator compares the same principal and term using monthly amortization. The horizon result includes payment differences, remaining loan balances and the upfront point cost. It is an estimate, not a loan offer or financial advice; lender rules, taxes and other closing costs can change the result.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"0d61f601730a69fc7fc6a11f65a2db6b471eff4fe78e3d1ee859a28bfce11ada","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Satu titik diskaun biasanya kos 1% daripada jumlah pinjaman. Masukkan kadar tanpa titik, kadar yang dikutip dengan titik dan kos titik. Kalkulator ini membandingkan prinsip dan tempoh yang sama menggunakan amortisasi bulanan. Hasil horizon termasuk perbezaan pembayaran, baki pinjaman yang tinggal dan kos titik awal. Ia adalah anggaran, bukan tawaran pinjaman atau nasihat kewangan; peraturan pemberi pinjaman, cukai dan kos penutupan lain boleh mengubah hasil.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
